{"seq":3,"slug":"async-io-patterns","title":"异步 I/O 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/io-optimization/async-io-patterns","wordCount":1244,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"异步-i-o-模式\">异步 I/O 模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>传统的同步阻塞 I/O 模型中，每个 I/O 操作都会阻塞调用线程直到完成。这意味着要处理 1000 个并发连接就需要 1000 个线程，而每个线程的栈空间（通常 1-8MB）和上下文切换开销使这种模型在高并发下难以扩展。<strong>异步 I/O</strong> 通过非阻塞操作和事件通知机制，让少量线程就能高效处理大量并发 I/O，是构建高性能网络服务的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 同步阻塞&#10;        A1[线程1] --&gt;|阻塞| B1[连接1]&#10;        A2[线程2] --&gt;|阻塞| B2[连接2]&#10;        A3[线程N] --&gt;|阻塞| B3[连接N]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 异步多路复用&#10;        C[事件循环线程] --&gt; D[连接1]&#10;        C --&gt; E[连接2]&#10;        C --&gt; F[连接N]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 同步阻塞\n        A1[线程1] --&gt;|阻塞| B1[连接1]\n        A2[线程2] --&gt;|阻塞| B2[连接2]\n        A3[线程N] --&gt;|阻塞| B3[连接N]\n    end\n    subgraph 异步多路复用\n        C[事件循环线程] --&gt; D[连接1]\n        C --&gt; E[连接2]\n        C --&gt; F[连接N]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>I/O 模型</th>\n<th>并发能力</th>\n<th>资源消耗</th>\n<th>编程复杂度</th>\n<th>典型实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同步阻塞</td>\n<td>低（线程数受限）</td>\n<td>高（每连接一线程）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>传统 Java BIO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非阻塞轮询</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中（CPU 忙等）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>O_NONBLOCK + 循环检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I/O 多路复用</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>select/poll/epoll/kqueue</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信号驱动</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>SIGIO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步 I/O (AIO)</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>io_uring, IOCP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"i-o-多路复用的演进\">I/O 多路复用的演进</h2><p>I/O 多路复用（I/O Multiplexing）允许单个线程同时监控多个文件描述符的就绪状态。Linux 上经历了 select → poll → epoll 的演进：</p>\n<p><strong>select</strong> 是最早的多路复用接口（1983）。每次调用需要传递所有监控的 fd 集合，内核线性扫描检查状态，返回后应用还需再次遍历找到就绪的 fd。</p>\n<p><strong>poll</strong> 去除了 select 的 1024 fd 限制，但性能特征不变——O(n) 扫描。</p>\n<p><strong>epoll</strong> 是 Linux 的高性能多路复用接口（2002）。核心改进是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>注册一次</strong>：fd 只需注册一次，不需要每次调用都传递</li>\n<li><strong>事件驱动</strong>：内核通过回调维护就绪列表，epoll_wait 只返回就绪的 fd</li>\n<li><strong>O(1) 就绪通知</strong>：就绪 fd 数量为 k 时，复杂度是 O(k) 而非 O(n)</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"#include &lt;sys/epoll.h&gt;&#10;#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;&#10;#include &lt;fcntl.h&gt;&#10;&#10;#define MAX_EVENTS 1024&#10;&#10;void event_loop(int listen_fd) {&#10;    int epfd = epoll_create1(0);&#10;&#10;    struct epoll_event ev;&#10;    ev.events = EPOLLIN | EPOLLET;  // 边沿触发模式&#10;    ev.data.fd = listen_fd;&#10;    epoll_ctl(epfd, EPOLL_CTL_ADD, listen_fd, &amp;ev);&#10;&#10;    struct epoll_event events[MAX_EVENTS];&#10;&#10;    while (1) {&#10;        int nready = epoll_wait(epfd, events, MAX_EVENTS, -1);&#10;        for (int i = 0; i &lt; nready; i++) {&#10;            if (events[i].data.fd == listen_fd) {&#10;                int client_fd = accept4(listen_fd, NULL, NULL, SOCK_NONBLOCK);&#10;                ev.events = EPOLLIN | EPOLLET;&#10;                ev.data.fd = client_fd;&#10;                epoll_ctl(epfd, EPOLL_CTL_ADD, client_fd, &amp;ev);&#10;            } else {&#10;                handle_client(events[i].data.fd);&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;sys/epoll.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;unistd.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;fcntl.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#define</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MAX_EVENTS</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> event_loop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> listen_fd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> epfd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> epoll_create1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> epoll_event ev;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ev.events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EPOLLIN </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EPOLLET;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 边沿触发模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ev.data.fd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> listen_fd;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    epoll_ctl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(epfd, EPOLL_CTL_ADD, listen_fd, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ev);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> epoll_event </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[MAX_EVENTS];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nready </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> epoll_wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(epfd, events, MAX_EVENTS, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nready; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i].data.fd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> listen_fd) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client_fd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> accept4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(listen_fd, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, SOCK_NONBLOCK);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                ev.events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EPOLLIN </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EPOLLET;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                ev.data.fd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client_fd;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                epoll_ctl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(epfd, EPOLL_CTL_ADD, client_fd, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ev);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                handle_client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i].data.fd);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>macOS/BSD 使用 <strong>kqueue</strong>，功能类似 epoll 但接口更统一。Windows 使用 <strong>IOCP</strong>（I/O Completion Ports），是真正的异步 I/O 模型——不是通知&quot;可以读了&quot;，而是通知&quot;读完了&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph I/O 多路复用演进&#10;        A[select 1983] --&gt;|去除 fd 上限| B[poll 1997]&#10;        B --&gt;|事件驱动,O1通知| C[epoll 2002]&#10;        C --&gt;|统一事件接口| D[kqueue BSD]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 真正的异步 I/O&#10;        E[IOCP Windows] --&gt; F[完成通知模型]&#10;        G[io_uring Linux 5.1] --&gt; F&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph I/O 多路复用演进\n        A[select 1983] --&gt;|去除 fd 上限| B[poll 1997]\n        B --&gt;|事件驱动,O1通知| C[epoll 2002]\n        C --&gt;|统一事件接口| D[kqueue BSD]\n    end\n    subgraph 真正的异步 I/O\n        E[IOCP Windows] --&gt; F[完成通知模型]\n        G[io_uring Linux 5.1] --&gt; F\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"事件驱动架构\">事件驱动架构</h2><p>基于 I/O 多路复用的<strong>事件驱动架构</strong>（Event-Driven Architecture）是高性能网络服务的标准模式。核心组件是<strong>事件循环</strong>（Event Loop）：单线程不断地等待事件、分发事件、处理回调。</p>\n<p><strong>Reactor 模式</strong>是最常见的事件驱动架构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"单 Reactor 单线程: 一个线程处理所有 I/O 事件和业务逻辑&#10;  → 适合: I/O 密集且业务处理极快（Redis）&#10;&#10;单 Reactor 多线程: 一个线程处理 I/O 事件，业务逻辑分发给线程池&#10;  → 适合: 业务处理有一定计算量&#10;&#10;主从 Reactor: 主线程处理 accept，子线程各自运行 Reactor 处理已建立的连接&#10;  → 适合: 大规模并发（Nginx, Netty）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>单 Reactor 单线程: 一个线程处理所有 I/O 事件和业务逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 适合: I/O 密集且业务处理极快（Redis）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>单 Reactor 多线程: 一个线程处理 I/O 事件，业务逻辑分发给线程池</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 适合: 业务处理有一定计算量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>主从 Reactor: 主线程处理 accept，子线程各自运行 Reactor 处理已建立的连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 适合: 大规模并发（Nginx, Netty）</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import asyncio&#10;&#10;async def handle_client(reader, writer):&#10;    data = await reader.read(4096)&#10;    response = process(data)&#10;    writer.write(response)&#10;    await writer.drain()&#10;    writer.close()&#10;&#10;async def main():&#10;    server = await asyncio.start_server(handle_client, &#39;0.0.0.0&#39;, 8080)&#10;    async with server:&#10;        await server.serve_forever()&#10;&#10;asyncio.run(main())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handle_client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reader, writer):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reader.read(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> process(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    writer.write(response)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> writer.drain()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    writer.close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    server </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.start_server(handle_client, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0.0.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8080</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> server:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> server.serve_forever()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">asyncio.run(main())</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Node.js、Nginx、Redis 都采用事件驱动架构。它们能够用极少的线程处理数万甚至数十万的并发连接，关键在于所有 I/O 操作都是非阻塞的，线程永远不会因为等待 I/O 而闲置。</p>\n<p>但事件驱动模型有一个关键约束：<strong>回调中不能有阻塞操作</strong>。一次阻塞调用（如同步数据库查询、密集计算）会阻塞整个事件循环，导致所有连接的处理都停滞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"协程与异步运行时\">协程与异步运行时</h2><p><strong>协程</strong>（Coroutine）解决了事件驱动模型中&quot;回调地狱&quot;和代码可读性差的问题。协程在语法上像同步代码，但在运行时是非阻塞的——遇到 I/O 时自动让出执行权给其他协程。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Go goroutine: 语言级协程，由 Go 运行时调度&#10;func handleConnection(conn net.Conn) {&#10;    defer conn.Close()&#10;    buf := make([]byte, 4096)&#10;    for {&#10;        n, err := conn.Read(buf)  // 看起来阻塞，实际上 goroutine 挂起，线程去处理其他工作&#10;        if err != nil {&#10;            return&#10;        }&#10;        conn.Write(process(buf[:n]))&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10;    ln, _ := net.Listen(&quot;tcp&quot;, &quot;:8080&quot;)&#10;    for {&#10;        conn, _ := ln.Accept()&#10;        go handleConnection(conn)  // 启动新 goroutine，极低开销（~2KB 栈）&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Go goroutine: 语言级协程，由 Go 运行时调度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">conn</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> net</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Conn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    buf </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        n, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Read</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(buf)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 看起来阻塞，实际上 goroutine 挂起，线程去处理其他工作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(buf[:n]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ln, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Listen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tcp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\":8080\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        conn, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ln.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Accept</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        go</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(conn)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 启动新 goroutine，极低开销（~2KB 栈）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// Rust async/await: 零成本抽象的异步运行时&#10;use tokio::net::TcpListener;&#10;use tokio::io::{AsyncReadExt, AsyncWriteExt};&#10;&#10;#[tokio::main]&#10;async fn main() {&#10;    let listener = TcpListener::bind(&quot;0.0.0.0:8080&quot;).await.unwrap();&#10;    loop {&#10;        let (mut socket, _) = listener.accept().await.unwrap();&#10;        tokio::spawn(async move {&#10;            let mut buf = [0u8; 4096];&#10;            loop {&#10;                let n = socket.read(&amp;mut buf).await.unwrap();&#10;                if n == 0 { return; }&#10;                socket.write_all(&amp;buf[..n]).await.unwrap();&#10;            }&#10;        });&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Rust async/await: 零成本抽象的异步运行时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio::net::TcpListener;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio::io::{AsyncReadExt, AsyncWriteExt};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[tokio::main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let listener = TcpListener::bind(\"0.0.0.0:8080\").await.unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let (mut socket, _) = listener.accept().await.unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tokio::spawn(async move {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let mut buf = [0u8; 4096];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                let n = socket.read(&#x26;mut buf).await.unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if n == 0 { return; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                socket.write_all(&#x26;buf[..n]).await.unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协程实现</th>\n<th>栈模型</th>\n<th>调度方式</th>\n<th>典型开销</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Go goroutine</td>\n<td>可增长栈（2KB 起）</td>\n<td>M:N 调度（runtime）</td>\n<td>~2 KB/goroutine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust async/await</td>\n<td>无栈（状态机编译）</td>\n<td>运行时调度（tokio）</td>\n<td>~几百字节/task</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python asyncio</td>\n<td>无栈</td>\n<td>单线程事件循环</td>\n<td>~1 KB/coroutine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Java Virtual Threads</td>\n<td>虚拟栈</td>\n<td>M:N 调度（JVM）</td>\n<td>~1 KB/虚拟线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kotlin coroutines</td>\n<td>无栈（CPS 变换）</td>\n<td>调度器可配置</td>\n<td>~几百字节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"io_uring-linux-现代异步-i-o\">io_uring：Linux 现代异步 I/O</h2><p><strong>io_uring</strong> 是 Linux 5.1 引入的革命性异步 I/O 接口。它通过共享内存的环形缓冲区（Submission Queue 和 Completion Queue）实现用户态和内核之间的零系统调用通信，极大减少了上下文切换开销。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"#include &lt;liburing.h&gt;&#10;&#10;void io_uring_echo_server(int listen_fd) {&#10;    struct io_uring ring;&#10;    io_uring_queue_init(256, &amp;ring, 0);&#10;&#10;    while (1) {&#10;        struct io_uring_sqe *sqe = io_uring_get_sqe(&amp;ring);&#10;        io_uring_prep_accept(sqe, listen_fd, NULL, NULL, 0);&#10;        io_uring_sqe_set_data(sqe, (void*)ACCEPT_EVENT);&#10;        io_uring_submit(&amp;ring);&#10;&#10;        struct io_uring_cqe *cqe;&#10;        io_uring_wait_cqe(&amp;ring, &amp;cqe);&#10;&#10;        int client_fd = cqe-&gt;res;&#10;        io_uring_cqe_seen(&amp;ring, cqe);&#10;&#10;        sqe = io_uring_get_sqe(&amp;ring);&#10;        io_uring_prep_read(sqe, client_fd, buf, BUF_SIZE, 0);&#10;        io_uring_submit(&amp;ring);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;liburing.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> io_uring_echo_server</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> listen_fd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> io_uring ring;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    io_uring_queue_init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ring, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> io_uring_sqe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sqe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> io_uring_get_sqe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ring);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        io_uring_prep_accept</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sqe, listen_fd, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        io_uring_sqe_set_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sqe, (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)ACCEPT_EVENT);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        io_uring_submit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ring);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> io_uring_cqe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cqe;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        io_uring_wait_cqe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ring, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cqe);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client_fd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cqe->res;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        io_uring_cqe_seen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ring, cqe);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sqe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> io_uring_get_sqe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ring);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        io_uring_prep_read</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sqe, client_fd, buf, BUF_SIZE, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        io_uring_submit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ring);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>io_uring 相比 epoll 的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>真正的异步 I/O</strong>：epoll 只通知&quot;可读&quot;，应用仍需调用 read()；io_uring 直接将读取结果放入完成队列</li>\n<li><strong>批量提交</strong>：一次 io_uring_submit() 可以提交多个 I/O 请求</li>\n<li><strong>零系统调用</strong>：使用 SQPOLL 模式，内核线程主动轮询提交队列，应用完全不需要系统调用</li>\n<li><strong>统一接口</strong>：支持文件 I/O、网络 I/O、定时器等所有操作</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((异步 I/O))&#10;    多路复用&#10;      select/poll&#10;      epoll/kqueue&#10;      事件驱动模型&#10;    架构模式&#10;      Reactor&#10;      单线程事件循环&#10;      主从多线程&#10;    协程&#10;      Go goroutine&#10;      Rust async/await&#10;      Java Virtual Threads&#10;      同步语法异步执行&#10;    io_uring&#10;      零系统调用&#10;      批量提交&#10;      真正异步&#10;      SQ/CQ 环形缓冲\">mindmap\n  root((异步 I/O))\n    多路复用\n      select/poll\n      epoll/kqueue\n      事件驱动模型\n    架构模式\n      Reactor\n      单线程事件循环\n      主从多线程\n    协程\n      Go goroutine\n      Rust async/await\n      Java Virtual Threads\n      同步语法异步执行\n    io_uring\n      零系统调用\n      批量提交\n      真正异步\n      SQ/CQ 环形缓冲</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>I/O 多路复用</strong>（epoll/kqueue）让少量线程处理大量并发连接，是高性能网络服务的基础</li>\n<li><strong>epoll</strong> 的 O(1) 就绪通知相比 select/poll 的 O(n) 扫描有本质性能优势</li>\n<li><strong>事件驱动架构</strong>的关键约束是回调中不能阻塞，任何阻塞都会影响所有连接</li>\n<li><strong>协程</strong>用同步的代码风格实现异步执行，Go goroutine 和 Rust async 是两种主流实现</li>\n<li><strong>io_uring</strong> 是 Linux 上最先进的异步 I/O 接口，通过共享内存环形缓冲实现零系统调用</li>\n<li>异步 I/O 选型的核心考量：<strong>并发规模、编程复杂度和生态成熟度</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"异步 I/O 模式","id":"异步-i-o-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"I/O 多路复用的演进","id":"i-o-多路复用的演进"},{"level":2,"text":"事件驱动架构","id":"事件驱动架构"},{"level":2,"text":"协程与异步运行时","id":"协程与异步运行时"},{"level":2,"text":"io_uring：Linux 现代异步 I/O","id":"io_uring-linux-现代异步-i-o"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"网络优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/io-optimization/network-optimization"},"next":{"title":"操作系统调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/system-tuning/os-tuning"}}